{
  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model with scvi_n200 encoder in a multiprofile setting, achieving validation accuracy of 0.650 and F1 of 0.628, outperforming the singleprofile baseline (0.520 accuracy). This suggests multiprofile configurations may benefit from the scvi_n200 encoder, though other factors could contribute to the improvement. The exact impact of profile setting remains uncertain without direct comparison to other configurations."
}

